<subpara id="RM000000NC000IX_07" type-id="51" category="05">
<name>Inspection Procedure</name>
</subpara>
<subpara id="RM000000NC000IX_08" type-id="01" category="01">
<name>Procedure</name>
<testgrp id="RM000000NC000IX_08_0005" proc-id="RM0550J___00007O600000">
<testtitle>Inspect Yaw Rate Sensor (Installation Condition)</testtitle>
<content6 releasenbr="1">
<test1>
<ptxt>Check the yaw rate sensor installation condition and check that the sensor is not tilted, the bracket is not deformed, and the installation is not loose.</ptxt>
<spec>
<title>Specified Condition</title>
<specitem>
<ptxt>Installed correctly</ptxt>
</specitem>
</spec>
</test1>
</content6>
<res>
<down ref="RM000000NC000IX_08_0006" fin="false">OK</down>
<right ref="RM000000NC000IX_08_0008" fin="true">NG</right>
</res>
</testgrp>
<testgrp id="RM000000NC000IX_08_0006" proc-id="RM0550J___00007O700000">
<testtitle>Replace Yaw Rate Sensor</testtitle>
<content6 releasenbr="1">
<test1>
<ptxt>Replace the yaw rate sensor. (see <xref label="Seep01" href="RM000003054000X"/>)</ptxt>
<atten3>
<list1 type="unordered">
<item>
<ptxt>If the yaw rate sensor is replaced, perform "Yaw Rate &amp; G Sensor 0-point Memory Clear and 0-point Acquisition" for the VSC system. (see <xref label="Seep02" href="RM000001A8300PX"/>)</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>If the yaw rate sensor is replaced, perform "AT/CVT Learned Value Initialization" for the CVT system, and always perform both "G Sensor 0-point Learning" and "CVT Hydraulic Pressure Learning". (see <xref label="Seep03" href="RM0000021F400AX"/>)</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>If the yaw rate sensor is replaced, perform "G Sensor 0-point Writing" for the intelligent parking assist system. (see <xref label="Seep04" href="RM0000002O8017X"/>)</ptxt>
</item>
</list1>
</atten3>
</test1>
</content6>
<res>
<down ref="RM000000NC000IX_08_0007" fin="true">NEXT</down>
</res>
</testgrp>
<testgrp id="RM000000NC000IX_08_0007">
<testtitle>END</testtitle>
</testgrp>
<testgrp id="RM000000NC000IX_08_0008">
<testtitle>Install the yaw rate sensor correctly<xref label="Seep01" href="RM000003054000X"/>
</testtitle>
</testgrp>
</subpara>
</para>
